@startuml "Memento - Text Editor (Homework) - Class Diagram"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title Undo and redo with two stacks of mementos
class TextEditor <<Originator>> {
  - text : String
  - cursor : int
  + type(String)
  + moveCursor(int)
  + save() : Snapshot
  + restore(Snapshot)
}
class "TextEditor.Snapshot" as Snapshot <<Memento>> {
  - text : String
  - cursor : int
}
class History <<Caretaker>> {
  - undo : Deque<Snapshot>
  - redo : Deque<Snapshot>
  + type(String)
  + undo()
  + redo()
}
History --> TextEditor
History --> "*" Snapshot : keeps
TextEditor ..> Snapshot : creates, reads
@enduml
